    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Unique and Versatile Property on Approximately One Acre A rare opportunity to acquire a truly distinctive property offering three independent living spaces in one, surrounded by mature grounds in a peaceful countryside setting. At the heart of the property is a spacious dormer bungalow with five well-proportioned bedrooms, three en-suite, a family bathroom, kitchen, sitting room and dining room. Adjoining the main residence is a self-contained one-bedroom annex, ideal for extended family, guests or independent living. On the opposite side is a beautifully finished self-contained one-bedroom cottage, modern and stylish throughout. A separate studio offers excellent potential as a home office, salon, treatment room or creative workspace, while to the rear is an impressive 1,200 sq. ft. gym/workshop, providing exceptional additional space for fitness, hobbies, storage or other uses. The property is surrounded by mature trees, offering privacy and tranquillity, while being conveniently located for Kilcock, Maynooth, Summerhill, Dunboyne, Dunshaughlin, Trim, Navan and Blanchardstown, with easy access to Dublin City, Dublin Airport and surrounding amenities. With its combination of versatile accommodation, extensive additional spaces and beautiful mature setting, this is a genuinely unusual property that needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated.\r\nContact John 086 8320042"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway \r\nTiled floor, spot lighting, alarm point. Solid ash stairs with under storage. Double door to the sittingroom\r\nSitting/Dining Room \r\nSolid timber floor, feature solid fuel burning stove marble heath, spot, center and wall light fitting, and T.V. point. Double height ceilings and full-length windows.\r\nFrench doors to the rear patio area.\r\nKitchen room \r\nTiled floor, floor & wall units, island with storage, Granit worktop and splash back, double oven, electric hob, extractor fan, American style  fridge. \r\nOffice/laundry room\r\nWood floors, built in units, with lots of space for airing/folding and storing cloths washing machine and dryer plumbed. L Door to annix.\r\nUpstairs Master Bedroom \r\nCarpet, light fitting, curtains and walk in wardrobe. Double doors to balcony from main bedroom.\r\nEnsuite 1\r\nFully tiled, with corner jacuzzi bath, separate shower and double sink. \r\nfitted mirror with shaving light, extractor fan and light fitting. Heated towel rail.\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nCarpet. Light fitting and walk in wardrobe, including shelving and hanging space. \r\nEnsuite 3\r\nFully tiled, w.h.b. mains shower, fitted mirror with shaving light, extractor fan and light fitting. Heated towel rail.\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nCarpet. Light fitting and wardrobe.\r\nDown stairs Bathroom \r\nTiled floor & wall, electric shower, w.c., w.h.b., extractor fan, light fitting and mirror with shaving light and heated towel rail.\r\nCottage to front \r\nKitchen/Living room\r\nTiled floor, Wall and floor & wall units, with walnut island with storage, quarts worktop, tiled splash back, double oven, electric hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge. \r\nTiled floor, feature solid fuel burning stove marble heath and T.V. point. Feature high ceilings.\r\nDown stairs Bedroom \r\nTiled floor, light fitting and curtains. \r\nEnsuite 1 \r\nFully tiled, w.h.b., mains shower, fitted mirror with, extractor fan and light fitting. Heated towel rail.\r\nWalk in Wardrobe\r\nTiled floor fully plumbed for washing built in storage units with hanging and door to main house.\r\nAnnex/Granny flat\r\nTV room \r\nCarpet, solid fuel stove, spot lights.\r\nKitchenet\r\nWall and floor units. \r\nBedroom1 \r\nCarpet flooring, curtains and light fitting. \r\nShower room \r\nTiled floor & wall, bath, shower, w.c., w.h.b., extractor fan, light fitting and mirror with.\r\nBer C2 no 119316586\r\nServices\tPrivate well and septic tank. 2 Oil fired burners central heating.\t\r\nIncluded \tAll Carpets, curtains, light fittings including and appliances depending on offer.\r\nSqft 2884 or 268 sqm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Great space, in both front and back garden for kids to play sport.\r\nLarge spacious 1 acre site\r\nUnder floor heating and rads upstairs.\r\nMaster bedroom has bathroom en-suite with corner jacuzzi bath, separate shower and double sink. Double doors to balcony from main bedroom.\r\nLarge contained limestone patio area\r\nVery close to Culmullen National school\r\nLocation 10 mins from Dunshaughlin/Dunboyne/Summerhill,15 mins Kilcock/Trim/Maynooth, 20 mins Blancharstown.\r\n9 mins drive to M3 Parkway train station (free parking all day)\r\nLarge house suitable for extended family living\r\nPebble driveway with ample parking front and side \r\nLarge garage • dived into 3 rooms \r\nVery large shed 30ft x 40ft currently used as gym but would be ideal work shop or builders dream, including large concrete area.\r\n Self-contained 1 bed apartment, kitchenet, bathroom and own door and heating.\r\nSite bounded by mature trees and hedging adding to privacy and protection from the weather\r\nLarge chicken run/dog run or pony paddock\r\nSitting room has double height ceiling and visable from hallway up staits\r\n3 bedrooms ensuite"
